{"overview":"«سیمین» (لیلا حاتمی) می خواهد به همراه همسرش نادر و دخترش ترمه از ایران برود و همه مقدمات این کار را فراهم کرده. اما نادر (پیمان معادی) نمی خواهد پدرش را که از بیماری آلزایمر رنج می برد تنها رها کند. این اختلافات باعث می شود سیمین از دادگاه درخواست طلاق کند اما دادگاه درخواستش را رد می کند و مجبور می شود که…","tagline":"حقیقت زشت، دروغ شیرین است.","overview_en":"A married couple are faced with a difficult decision – to improve the life of their child by moving to another country or to stay in Iran and look after a deteriorating parent who has Alzheimer's disease.","tagline_en":"Ugly truth, sweet lies.","runtime":123,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["اصغر فرهادی"],"crew_en":["Asghar Farhadi"],"countries":["IR","FR"],"cast":[{"name":"پیمان معادی","role":"Nader","photo":"/96dWXnLoCI32jiSSnn2jweaAjBU.jpg","en":"Payman Maadi"},{"name":"لیلا حاتمی","role":"Simin","photo":"/2ryc1fia5FJBACnUZSXh0muxrVO.jpg","en":"Leila Hatami"},{"name":"شهاب حسینی","role":"Hojjat","photo":"/6N567bATJxvhqNOIvdlkkyfpRw7.jpg","en":"Shahab Hosseini"},{"name":"ساره بیات","role":"Razieh","photo":"/el6WyRhfKq5HztB0HZwQWjV6ITn.jpg","en":"Sareh Bayat"},{"name":"Sarina Farhadi","role":"Termeh","photo":"/ppRlKN3lyMrjgsTbmp121DMBcUR.jpg"},{"name":"Ali-Asghar Shahbazi","role":"Nader's Father","photo":"/nzViwM5ccG5VXzV77W3ok1fOOji.jpg"},{"name":"مریلا زارعی","role":"Miss Ghahraii - Termeh's Teacher","photo":"/kahlfXf5WSNPo5egq6BMWTfi25h.jpg","en":"Merila Zarei"},{"name":"Babak Karimi","role":"Interrogator","photo":"/cOEaiBWzX6LgzmSBoZhzr4IYDSO.jpg"},{"name":"Kimia Hosseini","role":"Somayyeh - Razieh's Daughter","photo":"/p7EnEeWtaNc8YNUOZbYfCpBGvny.jpg"},{"name":"Armine Zeytounchian","role":"Mrs. Kalaani","photo":""},{"name":"Shirin Yazdanbakhsh","role":"Simin's Mother","photo":"/fyNGKwrVd0USWDiw18ZRC9VbY6Z.jpg"},{"name":"Mohammad Sajadian","role":"Soldier","photo":"/5epwP7mSJjiYm2OT7VWW0r2Uu3k.jpg"}],"trailer":"58Onuy5USTc","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themovie